            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your plan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Din plan rymmer inte fler appar. Ta bort en app, eller be om en större plan under Min plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your plan has no room for more apps. Delete one, or ask for a larger plan under My plan."
